testResultColumnMetadata;req;r;db;con;st;result;cnt;lt
⍝ Isolated test for result-column metadata wrappers with bounds guards.

:If 0=⎕NC'null'
    init 'lib/'
:EndIf

req←{0::⍺,' - FAILED: ',⎕DMX.Message ⋄ ⍵:⍺,' - OK' ⋄ ⍺,' - FAILED'}
r←⊂'Test Result Column Metadata Wrappers'

db←open ':memory:'
con←connect db
(st result)←api.duckdb_query con 'SELECT 1 AS id, ''x'' AS name' 6
r,←⊂'Query for result metadata wrappers' req DuckDBSuccess=st

:If DuckDBSuccess=st
    cnt←resultColumnCount result
    r,←⊂'resultColumnCount returns 2' req 2=cnt

    r,←⊂'resultColumnName(0) is id' req 'id'≡result resultColumnName 0
    r,←⊂'resultColumnName(1) is name' req 'name'≡result resultColumnName 1

    r,←⊂'resultColumnType(0) is INTEGER' req type.INTEGER=result resultColumnType 0
    r,←⊂'resultColumnType(1) is VARCHAR' req type.VARCHAR=result resultColumnType 1

    lt←result resultColumnLogicalType 0
    r,←⊂'resultColumnLogicalType(0) returned handle' req lt≠0
    :If lt≠0
        {}api.duckdb_destroy_logical_type ⊂lt
    :EndIf

    ⍝ Guarded out-of-range
    r,←⊂'resultColumnName(out-of-range) guarded empty' req 0=≢result resultColumnName cnt
    r,←⊂'resultColumnType(out-of-range) guarded INVALID' req type.INVALID=result resultColumnType cnt
    r,←⊂'resultColumnLogicalType(out-of-range) guarded null' req 0=result resultColumnLogicalType cnt

    {}api.duckdb_destroy_result ⊂result
:EndIf

⍝ Null guards
r,←⊂'resultColumnCount(null) guarded zero' req 0=resultColumnCount 0
r,←⊂'resultColumnName(null) guarded empty' req 0=≢0 resultColumnName 0
r,←⊂'resultColumnType(null) guarded INVALID' req type.INVALID=0 resultColumnType 0
r,←⊂'resultColumnLogicalType(null) guarded null' req 0=0 resultColumnLogicalType 0

{}disconnect con
{}close db

⎕←↑r
⎕←''
⎕←'Result column metadata wrapper testing complete!'

⍝ KSL 1.0.0
